{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 136,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Give thanks to the LORD, for he is good, for his loving kindness endures forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要称谢耶和华，因他本为善；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要稱謝耶和華，因他本為善；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Give thanks to the God of gods, for his loving kindness endures forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要称谢万神之神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要稱謝萬神之神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Give thanks to the Lord of lords, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要称谢万主之主，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要稱謝萬主之主，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who alone does great wonders, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那独行大奇事的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那獨行大奇事的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who by understanding made the heavens, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那用智慧造天的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那用智慧造天的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who spread out the earth above the waters, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那铺地在水以上的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那鋪地在水以上的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who made the great lights, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那造成大光的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那造成大光的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "the sun to rule by day, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他造日头管白昼，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他造日頭管白晝，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "the moon and stars to rule by night, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他造月亮星宿管黑夜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他造月亮星宿管黑夜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who struck down the Egyptian firstborn, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那击杀人之长子的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那擊殺人之長子的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "and brought out Israel from among them, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他领人从他们中间出来，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他領人從他們中間出來，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "with a strong hand, and with an outstretched arm, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他施展大能的手和伸出来的膀臂，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他施展大能的手和伸出來的膀臂，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who divided the Red Sea apart, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那分裂的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那分裂的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "and made Israel to pass through the middle of it, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他领从其中经过，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他領從其中經過，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "but overthrew Pharaoh and his army in the Red Sea, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "却把法老和他的军兵推翻在里，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "卻把法老和他的軍兵推翻在裏，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who led his people through the wilderness, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那引导自己的民行走旷野的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那引導自己的民行走曠野的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "to him who struck great kings, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那击杀大君王的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那擊殺大君王的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "and killed mighty kings, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他杀戮有名的君王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他殺戮有名的君王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "Sihon king of the Amorites, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "就是杀戮王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "就是殺戮王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "20",
      "en": {
        "text": "Og king of Bashan, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "又杀王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "又殺王，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "21",
      "en": {
        "text": "and gave their land as an inheritance, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他将他们的地赐他的百姓为业，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他將他們的地賜他的百姓為業，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "22",
      "en": {
        "text": "even a heritage to Israel his servant, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "就是赐他的仆人为业，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "就是賜他的僕人為業，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "23",
      "en": {
        "text": "who remembered us in our low estate, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他顾念我们在卑微的地步，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他顧念我們在卑微的地步，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "24",
      "en": {
        "text": "and has delivered us from our adversaries, for his loving kindness endures forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他救拔我们脱离敌人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他救拔我們脫離敵人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "25",
      "en": {
        "text": "who gives food to every creature, for his loving kindness endures forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他赐粮食给凡有血气的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他賜糧食給凡有血氣的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "26",
      "en": {
        "text": "Oh give thanks to the God of heaven, for his loving kindness endures forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要称谢天上的 神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要稱謝天上的上帝，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}